WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:18.280
I used to wait for the breaking point,

2
00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:22.040
the edge of shame and desperation,

3
00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:28.380
before I could lift my voice to You,

4
00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:32.020
falling into Your healing arms.

5
00:00:33.860 --> 00:00:40.420
But Your mercy outlasts dark nights —

6
00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:44.800
it knocks at my door each morning.

7
00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:50.960
Now I know, turning to You isn't weakness;

8
00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:55.480
it isn't crawling back in shame.

9
00:00:56.080 --> 00:00:59.440
I stand tallest on my knees in prayer.

10
00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:08.120
Worldly sorrow heals no wounds,

11
00:01:08.520 --> 00:01:12.540
it's just a cell that locks me in;

12
00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:18.300
it never once has made me clean —

13
00:01:18.940 --> 00:01:23.340
it only names my grief and sins.

14
00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:28.380
But the sorrow that comes from Heaven

15
00:01:28.380 --> 00:01:33.760
is a door thrown open wide;

16
00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:38.700
it does not leave me in despair —

17
00:01:39.620 --> 00:01:44.600
and Heaven whispers gently: come unto me.

18
00:01:45.720 --> 00:01:50.200
So keep me turning, Lord, morning and night —

19
00:01:50.980 --> 00:01:56.080
till my whole heart leans to You.

20
00:01:56.780 --> 00:02:01.440
When I wander, when I'm weary, when I'm cold,

21
00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:06.480
Savior, help me turn to what is warm and true.

22
00:02:07.540 --> 00:02:12.400
I never could climb alone to Heaven;

23
00:02:13.020 --> 00:02:16.960
this broken soul was never mine to mend.

24
00:02:17.840 --> 00:02:23.260
So Jesus, keep me turning to You,

25
00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:28.880
walking the path that leads me home.

26
00:02:31.160 --> 00:02:35.820
There are choices I keep in shadow,

27
00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:40.820
there are words I will not say,

28
00:02:40.820 --> 00:02:46.840
and the weight of what I'm hiding

29
00:02:46.840 --> 00:02:52.220
only grows from day to day.

30
00:02:53.060 --> 00:02:57.980
So I put these things upon Your altar,

31
00:02:57.980 --> 00:03:03.220
and I name them in the light —

32
00:03:04.180 --> 00:03:09.080
and the things I thought would ruin me

33
00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:14.620
loosed their hold on me this night.

34
00:03:15.080 --> 00:03:20.360
So keep me turning, Lord, morning and night —

35
00:03:21.320 --> 00:03:25.500
till my whole heart leans to You.

36
00:03:26.450 --> 00:03:31.120
When I wander, when I'm weary, when I'm cold,

37
00:03:31.360 --> 00:03:36.300
Savior, help me turn to what is warm and true.

38
00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:42.040
I never could climb alone to Heaven;

39
00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:46.600
this broken soul was never mine to mend.

40
00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:53.140
So Jesus, keep me turning to You,

41
00:03:53.740 --> 00:03:58.860
walking the path that leads me home.

42
00:04:00.700 --> 00:04:04.080
Grace was never wages waiting

43
00:04:04.080 --> 00:04:08.860
at the ending of the fight;

44
00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:15.220
grace is strength inside the struggle,

45
00:04:17.580 --> 00:04:20.680
grace is power for the climb.

46
00:04:22.840 --> 00:04:26.500
Line upon line You remake me —

47
00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:33.220
You are not done with me yet —

48
00:04:34.070 --> 00:04:37.600
not a Judge who counts my failures,

49
00:04:37.600 --> 00:04:44.380
but a Father who forgives.

50
00:04:45.060 --> 00:04:48.440
And the sins I laid before You,

51
00:04:50.760 --> 00:04:54.660
You remember them no more,

52
00:04:56.280 --> 00:04:59.680
till I stand within Your glory,

53
00:05:01.740 --> 00:05:06.560
unashamed before the Lord.

54
00:05:07.920 --> 00:05:13.380
So keep me turning, Lord, morning and night —

55
00:05:14.420 --> 00:05:18.220
till my whole heart belongs to You.

56
00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:22.380
And when I stand within Your glory,

57
00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:26.420
let me fear Your face no more —

58
00:05:26.420 --> 00:05:28.580
not because I never wandered,

59
00:05:31.820 --> 00:05:35.180
but because Your mercy stayed;

60
00:05:36.880 --> 00:05:40.660
Jesus, You kept me turning,

61
00:05:42.740 --> 00:05:45.180
till I stand before You saved.

62
00:05:46.460 --> 00:05:54.040
New every morning, Your mercies never end.

63
00:05:54.040 --> 00:06:02.140
New every morning — turn me home again.

64
00:06:03.680 --> 00:06:07.880
In the name of Jesus Christ, amen.
